msgid "Without an answer within {n} day, it leaves the board. You can put it back from My listings at any time."
msgid_plural "Without an answer within {n} days, it leaves the board. You can put it back from My listings at any time."
msgstr[0] "Uden svar inden for {n} dag bliver den taget offline. Du kan altid sætte den online igen fra Mine annoncer."
msgstr[1] "Uden svar inden for {n} dage bliver den taget offline. Du kan altid sætte den online igen fra Mine annoncer."

