#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj src/s_exp/jumble/view/layout.clj
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Privatliv"

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "{app-name} is run by and for its community. This page says what it keeps about you, and why."
msgstr "{app-name} drives af og for sit fællesskab. Denne side fortæller, hvad der gemmes om dig, og hvorfor."

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "What is kept"
msgstr "Hvad der gemmes"

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Your name and email address, from signing in; what you post: listings, their photos and your messages; your favorites, saved searches and settings; and reports you make."
msgstr "Dit navn og din e-mailadresse fra login; det, du opretter: annoncer, deres billeder og dine beskeder; dine favoritter, gemte søgninger og indstillinger; og de anmeldelser, du laver."

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Why"
msgstr "Hvorfor"

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Only to run {app-name}: to show your listings, deliver your messages and send you emails: those you asked for, and a weekly summary of what is new, which you can turn off. Nothing is sold or shared for advertising, and there is no tracking and no analytics."
msgstr "Kun for at drive {app-name}: for at vise dine annoncer, levere dine beskeder og sende dig e-mails – dem, du har bedt om, og en ugentlig oversigt over nyt, som du kan slå fra. Intet sælges eller deles til annoncering, og der er hverken sporing eller statistik."

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Who sees what"
msgstr "Hvem ser hvad"

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Other members see your name, your listings and what you write to them. Messages are between you and the person you write to. Moderators see reports, and can remove listings."
msgstr "Andre medlemmer ser dit navn, dine annoncer og det, du skriver til dem. Beskeder er mellem dig og den, du skriver til. Moderatorer ser anmeldelser og kan fjerne annoncer."

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Cookies"

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Only those {app-name} needs: one keeps you signed in, one remembers your light or dark theme, and one protects signing in. No tracking cookies."
msgstr "Kun dem, {app-name} har brug for: én holder dig logget ind, én husker dit lyse eller mørke tema, og én beskytter login. Ingen sporingscookies."

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Services involved"
msgstr "Involverede tjenester"

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Photos and backups are stored with your community's storage provider, emails go through its email provider, and signing in may go through its sign-in service. Notifications you turn on go through your browser's push service (Google's, Apple's, Mozilla's or Microsoft's), encrypted: it sees only when one is sent."
msgstr "Billeder og backups opbevares hos dit fællesskabs lagerudbyder, e-mails sendes via dets e-mailudbyder, og login kan gå via dets login-tjeneste. Notifikationer, du slår til, går krypteret via din browsers push-tjeneste (Googles, Apples, Mozillas eller Microsofts): den kan kun se, hvornår en notifikation bliver sendt."

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "New listings are also announced in your community's chat channel: their title, price, category and pickup place, with a link; not who posted them."
msgstr "Nye annoncer meddeles også i dit fællesskabs chatkanal: deres titel, pris, kategori og afhentningssted, med et link; ikke hvem der oprettede dem."

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "How long"
msgstr "Hvor længe"

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Until you remove it, or delete your account; then the messages you wrote stay with those you wrote to, and your reports with the moderators, without your name. Backups keep deleted data for a while, usually up to three months."
msgstr "Indtil du fjerner det eller sletter din konto; så bliver de beskeder, du har skrevet, hos modtagerne, og dine anmeldelser hos moderatorerne, uden dit navn. Backups beholder slettede data et stykke tid, som regel op til tre måneder."

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Announcements of new listings stay in the chat channel's history, after the listing or your account is deleted, and the channel may be readable beyond the community."
msgstr "Meddelelser om nye annoncer bliver i chatkanalens historik, også efter at annoncen eller din konto er slettet, og kanalen kan være læsbar uden for fællesskabet."

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Your choices"
msgstr "Dine valg"

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Download everything {app-name} keeps about you, or delete your account, from {settings}."
msgstr "Download alt, hvad {app-name} gemmer om dig, eller slet din konto under {settings}."

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Questions"
msgstr "Spørgsmål"

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Write to {contact}."
msgstr "Skriv til {contact}."

#: src/s_exp/jumble/page/privacy.clj
msgid "Ask your community's moderators."
msgstr "Spørg dit fællesskabs moderatorer."

